  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your hammer throw mows down enemies in its path like a steel meteor.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Thrown Slam<sup>BPFHT</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat in place of an attack. If you use a standard action, you increase the length of the line by 5 feet, plus 5 feet per 2 mythic tiers you possess, and reduce the attack roll penalty for using this feat by 1 per 2 mythic tiers you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc120\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
